WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.520
To put concrete numbers on it: sampling speedups of
two to four times across the board.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.378
StableDiffusion version 2 drops from fifty seconds
to fourteen-point-six seconds per image.

00:00:11.458 --> 00:00:16.463
On LSUN Church, FID barely moves, from
twelve-point-eight to twelve-point-nine,

00:00:16.543 --> 00:00:18.973
while running almost four times faster.

00:00:19.053 --> 00:00:24.509
And the deep reason it scales is that the number of
parallel iterations to converge is

00:00:24.589 --> 00:00:28.500
up to twenty times smaller than the thousand
sequential steps.
